      "id": "word-las--clock-time",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "las",
      "answerEn": "no separate English word; used before plural clock hours",
      "noteEn": "The understood word is horas, a feminine plural noun, so Spanish uses las before two o'clock and every later hour. One o'clock instead uses la: es la una.",
      "example": {
        "es": "La clase empieza a las nueve.",
        "en": "The class starts at nine."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "article", "clock time", "feminine plural", "A1"]
